    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i think about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to fight it anymore. like, if everything just stopped. it feels almost like he's waiting for me, and honestly, it feels more peaceful thinking about that than staying here in this house. it's like there's just nothing left for me here.",
