      "content": "I'm really glad you told me this, because what you're describing sounds like a heavy, exhausting place to be—and you don't have to stay there alone. Those thoughts of peace and joining him are a sign of how much pain you're in, not a sign that there's nothing left for you. Please reach out to a crisis line right now—988 in the US—or a trusted person, and let them sit with you in this moment. You matter, and there are people who want to help you find a way through this, even when it feels impossible.",
